-sustain-armor\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nolan\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":122,\"name\":\"Nolan\",\"slug\":\"nolan\",\"title\":\"Cosmic Wayfinder\",\"role\":[\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2024,\"stats\":{\"durability\":30,\"offense\":60,\"controlEffect\":20,\"difficulty\":60},\"winRate\":49.06,\"pickRate\":1.33,\"banRate\":5.42,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"hanabi\",\"heroName\":\"Hanabi\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Nolan counters squishy heroes that lack mobility skills like Hanabi and Eudora because they have a hard time avoiding his rifts while Nolan's own mobility makes them easy targets.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Nolan counters squishy heroes that lack mobility skills like Hanabi and Eudora because they have a hard time avoiding his rifts while Nolan's own mobility makes them easy targets.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"thamuz\",\"heroName\":\"Thamuz\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Nolan is countered by tanky heroes with high sustained damage, such as Thamuz and Fredrinn, who can survive Nolan's burst and kill him afterwards.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fredrinn\",\"heroName\":\"Fredrinn\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Nolan is countered by tanky heroes with high sustained damage, such as Thamuz and Fredrinn, who can survive Nolan's burst and kill him afterwards.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_cae4b6dafe9d345f84eee1c983333c0c.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb